fusion-row fusion-flex-align-items-stretch fusion-flex-content-wrap\" style=\"max-width:1144px;margin-left: calc(-4% \/ 2 );margin-right: calc(-4% \/ 2 );\"><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-1 fusion_builder_column_1_2 1_2 fusion-flex-column\" style=\"--awb-padding-top:20px;--awb-padding-right:20px;--awb-padding-bottom:20px;--awb-padding-left:20px;--awb-bg-color:#afe5e6;--awb-bg-color-hover:#afe5e6;--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-width-large:50%;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:3.84%;--awb-margin-bottom-large:20px;--awb-spacing-left-large:3.84%;--awb-width-medium:50%;--awb-spacing-right-medium:3.84%;--awb-spacing-left-medium:3.84%;--awb-width-small:100%;--awb-spacing-right-small:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-small:1.92%;\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\"><div class=\"fusion-text fusion-text-2\"><p>From the moment you say \u201cYes\u201d to the day you say \u201cI Do\u201d Eleanor Gail will manage and oversee your celebration to ensure it runs smoothly. It is important that for each client we work with we get a real sense of their ideas, style, personality and inspirations. We support and inspire the client to transform their vision into reality and ensure the essence of the client is reflected within their wedding. You may already have a vision of your dream day, if not we will find it together\u2026..<\/p>\n<h3>Full or Partial Wedding &amp; Event Planning<\/h3>\n<p>Our wedding planning and design is tailor-made around our clients and we work in whichever way suits you. We are flexible for a reason, no two weddings, or brides, are the same so we offer you a bespoke service rather than shoe-horning you into an existing package.<\/p>\n<p>Our approach is simple, we offer venues that match your type of celebration and suit your budget. Once your venue is secured, we then fill in the details from the dress, the ceremony, flowers, the cake, catering, photography, stationary and transport right through to your honeymoon.<\/p>\n<p>As we plan your wedding, we can work around you in whatever way suits, creating a celebration that exceeds your expectations.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-2 fusion_builder_column_1_2 1_2 fusion-flex-column\" style=\"--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-width-large:50%;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:3.84%;--awb-margin-bottom-large:20px;--awb-spacing-left-large:3.84%;--awb-width-medium:50%;--awb-spacing-right-medium:3.84%;--awb-spacing-left-medium:3.84%;--awb-width-small:100%;--awb-spacing-right-small:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-small:1.92%;\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\"><div class=\"fusion-image-element \" style=\"text-align:center;--awb-caption-title-font-family:var(--h2_typography-font-family);--awb-caption-title-font-weight:var(--h2_typography-font-weight);--awb-caption-title-font-style:var(--h2_typography-font-style);--awb-caption-title-size:var(--h2_typography-font-size);--awb-caption-title-transform:var(--h2_typography-text-transform);--awb-caption-title-line-height:var(--h2_typography-line-height);--awb-caption-title-letter-spacing:var(--h2_typography-letter-spacing);\"><span class=\" fusion-imageframe imageframe-none imageframe-1 hover-type-none\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"600\" alt=\"Wedding proposal\" title=\"Wedding proposal\" src=\"https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/03\/proposal_mike_glenna-16-of-33-400x600.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive wp-image-194\" srcset=\"https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/03\/proposal_mike_glenna-16-of-33-200x300.jpg 200w, https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/03\/proposal_mike_glenna-16-of-33-400x600.jpg 400w, https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/03\/proposal_mike_glenna-16-of-33-600x900.jpg 600w, https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/03\/proposal_mike_glenna-16-of-33.jpg 650w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 600px\" \/><\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"fusion-fullwidth fullwidth-box fusion-builder-row-3 fusion-flex-container nonhundred-percent-fullwidth non-hundred-percent-height-scrolling\" style=\"--awb-border-radius-top-left:0px;--awb-border-radius-top-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-right:0px;--awb-border-radius-bottom-left:0px;--awb-flex-wrap:wrap;\" ><div class=\"fusion-builder-row fusion-row fusion-flex-align-items-stretch fusion-flex-content-wrap\" style=\"max-width:1144px;margin-left: calc(-4% \/ 2 );margin-right: calc(-4% \/ 2 );\"><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-3 fusion_builder_column_1_2 1_2 fusion-flex-column\" style=\"--awb-padding-top:20px;--awb-padding-right:20px;--awb-padding-bottom:20px;--awb-padding-left:20px;--awb-bg-color:#afe5e6;--awb-bg-color-hover:#afe5e6;--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-width-large:50%;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:3.84%;--awb-margin-bottom-large:20px;--awb-spacing-left-large:3.84%;--awb-width-medium:50%;--awb-spacing-right-medium:3.84%;--awb-spacing-left-medium:3.84%;--awb-width-small:100%;--awb-spacing-right-small:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-small:1.92%;\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\"><div class=\"fusion-text fusion-text-3\"><h3>Last Minute Management<\/h3>\n<p>If you find with weeks to go before your big day you need an extra pair of hands to help with last minute details or on the day support, we offer last minute management for the 6 weeks before the wedding and wedding day assistance.<\/p>\n<p>Following an initial consultation we will ensure everything is in place and offer solutions to any problems or missing elements. We will then contact all suppliers confirming orders are in place, ensuring your budget is correct and create a wedding schedule. We then oversee and manage each and every part of your day making sure you can relax in the knowledge that everything is being arranged exactly as you planned.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-4 fusion_builder_column_1_2 1_2 fusion-flex-column\" style=\"--awb-bg-size:cover;--awb-width-large:50%;--awb-margin-top-large:0px;--awb-spacing-right-large:3.84%;--awb-margin-bottom-large:20px;--awb-spacing-left-large:3.84%;--awb-width-medium:50%;--awb-spacing-right-medium:3.84%;--awb-spacing-left-medium:3.84%;--awb-width-small:100%;--awb-spacing-right-small:1.92%;--awb-spacing-left-small:1.92%;\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\"><div class=\"fusion-image-element \" style=\"text-align:center;--awb-caption-title-font-family:var(--h2_typography-font-family);--awb-caption-title-font-weight:var(--h2_typography-font-weight);--awb-caption-title-font-style:var(--h2_typography-font-style);--awb-caption-title-size:var(--h2_typography-font-size);--awb-caption-title-transform:var(--h2_typography-text-transform);--awb-caption-title-line-height:var(--h2_typography-line-height);--awb-caption-title-letter-spacing:var(--h2_typography-letter-spacing);\"><span class=\" fusion-imageframe imageframe-none imageframe-2 hover-type-none\"><a class=\"fusion-no-lightbox\" href=\"http:\/\/emeottphoto.com\/\" target=\"_self\" aria-label=\"married couple\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"389\" alt=\"Romantic proposal\" src=\"https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/married-couple-grey-edit.jpg\" class=\"img-responsive wp-image-1530\" srcset=\"https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/married-couple-grey-edit-200x195.jpg 200w, https:\/\/eleanorgail.co.uk\/wp-content\/uploads\/2018\/11\/married-couple-grey-edit.jpg 400w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 400px\" \/><\/a><\/span><\/div><\/div><